# Photos of real rooms and real products, and everything a run produces from
# them. Versioned only by a deliberate `git add -f`, once the authorisation
# recorded in the case manifest actually permits it.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.heic
runs/

# The manifests themselves are the corpus's index and DO belong in git: they
# carry the provenance, the measurements and the expectation, and none of them
# is a photograph.
!cases/*.json
